Package: galaxyxr-mini-tools
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Small tools for the Samsung Galaxy XR
 rpmb reads the UFS RPMB of the headset: its write counter or its data.
 uefivars lists the UEFI variables in a dump of the RPMB or of the
 uefivarstore partition.
